<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>授权要在执行那一刻发生</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 400, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>授权要在执行那一刻发生</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8}}>authorize at execution,<br />not at generation</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 728, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具调用的形状可以被伪造</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>绕过模型回合。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行端只相信「这看起来像一次合法调用」</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>独立授权就此缺失。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #A32D2D", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>动作仍然会发生</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>没有人在执行端拦它。</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 6}}>审批不能挂在「它说它会怎么干」上。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>22 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
